(5011, '就業人口とは、労働力人口の中で、職業に就いて収入を得ている人の数のことです。 就業人口は、就業中の就業者と、何らかの事情により就業していない休業者に分けられます。', 'The working population refers to the number of individuals within the labor force who are employed and earning income. The working population can be further categorized into two groups: those who are actively working, and those who are on leave and not working due to various reasons.', 27, '{"Ja": "就業人口とは、労働力人口の中で、職業に就いて収入を得ている人の数のことです。 就業人口は、就業中の就業者と、何らかの事情により就業していない休業者に分けられます。", "En": "The working population refers to the number of individuals within the labor force who are employed and earning income. The working population can be further categorized into two groups: those who are actively working, and those who are on leave and not working due to various reasons.", "Level": 27, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5011, "Characters": "就業"}, {"SubjectId": 3402, "Characters": "人口"}, {"SubjectId": 3270, "Characters": "労働"}, {"SubjectId": 2520, "Characters": "中"}, {"SubjectId": 4597, "Characters": "職業"}, {"SubjectId": 3475, "Characters": "付く"}, {"SubjectId": 4590, "Characters": "収入"}, {"SubjectId": 4198, "Characters": "得る"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 2475, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 3066, "Characters": "数"}, {"SubjectId": 3082, "Characters": "事"}, {"SubjectId": 2781, "Characters": "何"}, {"SubjectId": 3539, "Characters": "事情"}, {"SubjectId": 9180, "Characters": "する"}, {"SubjectId": 2599, "Characters": "分ける"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 1328, "Characters": "就"}, {"SubjectId": 756, "Characters": "業"}, {"SubjectId": 444, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 452, "Characters": "口"}, {"SubjectId": 788, "Characters": "労"}, {"SubjectId": 809, "Characters": "働"}, {"SubjectId": 447, "Characters": "力"}, {"SubjectId": 469, "Characters": "中"}, {"SubjectId": 1189, "Characters": "職"}, {"SubjectId": 1186, "Characters": "収"}, {"SubjectId": 445, "Characters": "入"}, {"SubjectId": 1081, "Characters": "得"}, {"SubjectId": 703, "Characters": "数"}, {"SubjectId