(5190, '三年前、サシ飲みの途中にさ、親友がスマホも財布も置いたまま、突然ふらりと店を出たんだよね。で、そのまま消息を絶っちゃったの。', 'Three years ago, when just the two of us went out drinking, my best friend suddenly got up and just walked out of the bar, leaving his smartphone and wallet behind. And then I never heard from him ever again.', 28, '{"Ja": "三年前、サシ飲みの途中にさ、親友がスマホも財布も置いたまま、突然ふらりと店を出たんだよね。で、そのまま消息を絶っちゃったの。", "En": "Three years ago, when just the two of us went out drinking, my best friend suddenly got up and just walked out of the bar, leaving his smartphone and wallet behind. And then I never heard from him ever again.", "Level": 28, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5190, "Characters": "絶つ"}, {"SubjectId": 2486, "Characters": "三"}, {"SubjectId": 3413, "Characters": "年"}, {"SubjectId": 2908, "Characters": "前"}, {"SubjectId": 3192, "Characters": "飲む"}, {"SubjectId": 5095, "Characters": "途中"}, {"SubjectId": 3226, "Characters": "親友"}, {"SubjectId": 4192, "Characters": "財布"}, {"SubjectId": 4514, "Characters": "置く"}, {"SubjectId": 4961, "Characters": "突然"}, {"SubjectId": 2894, "Characters": "店"}, {"SubjectId": 2557, "Characters": "出る"}, {"SubjectId": 9205, "Characters": "その"}, {"SubjectId": 4858, "Characters": "断つ"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 449, "Characters": "三"}, {"SubjectId": 546, "Characters": "年"}, {"SubjectId": 633, "Characters": "前"}, {"SubjectId": 755, "Characters": "飲"}, {"SubjectId": 1341, "Characters": "途"}, {"SubjectId": 469, "Characters": "中"}, {"SubjectId": 770, "Characters": "親"}, {"SubjectId": 504, "Characters": "友"}, {"SubjectId": 1064, "Characters": "財"}, {"SubjectId": 1062, "Characters": "布"}, {"SubjectId": 1164, "Characters": "置"}, {"SubjectId": 1304, "Characters": "突"}, {"SubjectId": 881, "Characters": "然"}, {"SubjectId": 625, "Characters": "店"}, {"SubjectId": 483, "Characters": "出"}, {"SubjectId": 819, "Characters": "消"}, {"SubjectId": 815, "Characters": "息"}, {"SubjectId": 1371, "Characters": "絶"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": 2486, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "三", "conjugation_