(5201, '優秀な人は成長できる場に行きたがるんで、「高い目標」を目指している企業には、良い人材が多いんです。逆説的に言えば、良い人が集まらない企業は、目標が低いんですよ。', 'Excellent people want to go to places where they can grow, so companies that aim "high" have a lot of talented people. Paradoxically, companies that do not attract good people have low goals.', 28, '{"Ja": "優秀な人は成長できる場に行きたがるんで、「高い目標」を目指している企業には、良い人材が多いんです。逆説的に言えば、良い人が集まらない企業は、目標が低いんですよ。", "En": "Excellent people want to go to places where they can grow, so companies that aim \"high\" have a lot of talented people. Paradoxically, companies that do not attract good people have low goals.", "Level": 28, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5201, "Characters": "逆説"}, {"SubjectId": 4653, "Characters": "優秀"}, {"SubjectId": 2475, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 3418, "Characters": "出来る"}, {"SubjectId": 2775, "Characters": "行く"}, {"SubjectId": 2968, "Characters": "高い"}, {"SubjectId": 3603, "Characters": "目標"}, {"SubjectId": 4885, "Characters": "居る"}, {"SubjectId": 3311, "Characters": "良い"}, {"SubjectId": 2754, "Characters": "多い"}, {"SubjectId": 2838, "Characters": "言う"}, {"SubjectId": 3557, "Characters": "集まる"}, {"SubjectId": 3258, "Characters": "低い"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 1206, "Characters": "優"}, {"SubjectId": 1216, "Characters": "秀"}, {"SubjectId": 444, "Characters": "人"}, {"SubjectId": 780, "Characters": "成"}, {"SubjectId": 632, "Characters": "長"}, {"SubjectId": 694, "Characters": "場"}, {"SubjectId": 580, "Characters": "行"}, {"SubjectId": 666, "Characters": "高"}, {"SubjectId": 492, "Characters": "目"}, {"SubjectId": 879, "Characters": "標"}, {"SubjectId": 797, "Characters": "指"}, {"SubjectId": 1153, "Characters": "企"}, {"SubjectId": 756, "Characters": "業"}, {"SubjectId": 805, "Characters": "良"}, {"SubjectId": 909, "Characters": "材"}, {"SubjectId": 570, "Characters": "多"}, {"SubjectId": 1346, "Characters": "逆"}, {"SubjectId": 1026, "Characters": "説"}, {"SubjectId": 914, "Characters": "的"}, {"SubjectId": 593, "Characters": "言"}, {"SubjectId": 754, "Characters": "集"}, {"