(5118, '大きくなった国家に必ず官僚主義がはびこるように、大きくなった組織は、みんな大企業病にかかるんです。いわゆる官僚組織ってやつですよ。', 'Just as bureaucratism inevitably spreads in a large nation, every large organization ends up suffering from what we call "big company syndrome." It''s what you might refer to as a bureaucratic organization.', 29, '{"Ja": "大きくなった国家に必ず官僚主義がはびこるように、大きくなった組織は、みんな大企業病にかかるんです。いわゆる官僚組織ってやつですよ。", "En": "Just as bureaucratism inevitably spreads in a large nation, every large organization ends up suffering from what we call \"big company syndrome.\" It''s what you might refer to as a bureaucratic organization.", "Level": 29, "SourceVocabulary": [{"SubjectId": 5118, "Characters": "官僚"}, {"SubjectId": 2499, "Characters": "大きい"}, {"SubjectId": 3252, "Characters": "成る"}, {"SubjectId": 2943, "Characters": "必ず"}, {"SubjectId": 4477, "Characters": "主義"}, {"SubjectId": 5071, "Characters": "組織"}, {"SubjectId": 5003, "Characters": "掛かる"}, {"SubjectId": 5758, "Characters": "奴"}], "KanjiInSentence": [{"SubjectId": 453, "Characters": "大"}, {"SubjectId": 621, "Characters": "国"}, {"SubjectId": 660, "Characters": "家"}, {"SubjectId": 655, "Characters": "必"}, {"SubjectId": 1018, "Characters": "官"}, {"SubjectId": 1392, "Characters": "僚"}, {"SubjectId": 528, "Characters": "主"}, {"SubjectId": 1154, "Characters": "義"}, {"SubjectId": 670, "Characters": "組"}, {"SubjectId": 1323, "Characters": "織"}, {"SubjectId": 1153, "Characters": "企"}, {"SubjectId": 756, "Characters": "業"}, {"SubjectId": 773, "Characters": "病"}], "Morphemes": [{"SubjectId": 2499, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "大きく", "conjugation_type": "形容詞", "conjugation_form": "連用形-一般", "lemma_reading": "オオキイ", "lemma": "大きい", "orth": "大きく", "pron": "オーキク", "Pos1": {"Ja": "形容詞", "En": "adjective"}, "Pos2": {"Ja": "一般", "En": "general"}}, {"SubjectId": 3252, "CombinedForm": null, "surface": "なっ", "conjugation_type": "五段-ラ行", "conjugation_form": "連用形-促音便", "lemma_reading": "ナル", "lemma": "成る", "orth": "なっ", "pron": "ナッ", "Pos1": {"Ja": "動詞", "En": "verb"}, "Pos2": {"Ja